<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>CarlChinese｜一起讀懂中文</title>
    <style>
      :root { color: #241f1a; background: #f7f5f0; font-family: ui-serif, "Noto Serif TC", serif; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { max-width: 56rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.25rem 6rem; line-height: 1.8; }
      header { border-bottom: 1px solid #d9d1c6; padding-bottom: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4rem); line-height: 1.2; margin: .5rem 0; }
      h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0; }
      .areas { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
      .areas section { border: 1px solid #d9d1c6; padding: 1.4rem; }
      .areas p { margin: .4rem 0 0; }
      a { color: #7c351f; text-underline-offset: .2em; }
      @media (min-width: 42rem) { .areas { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <header>
        <p>CarlChinese</p>
        <h1>一起讀懂中文</h1>
        <p>寫給臺灣讀者：從日常字詞、古典詩文到臺灣文學，慢慢讀，仔細想，也能與孩子一起討論。</p>
      </header>
      <div class="areas">
        <section aria-labelledby="daily"><h2 id="daily">生活國語</h2><p>從日常的字音、字形與用詞疑問出發，理解語言的由來。詞條內容仍在準備中。</p></section>
        <section aria-labelledby="classics"><h2 id="classics">古典詩文</h2><p>讓成人重新讀懂作品，也讓家長有材料陪孩子共讀。先從《唐詩三百首》開始。</p><p><a href="/tang300/">閱讀《唐詩三百首》目錄</a></p></section>
        <section aria-labelledby="taiwan"><h2 id="taiwan">臺灣文學</h2><p>從已進入公有領域的作品認識臺灣文學；系列與作品仍在準備中。</p></section>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
